# Pavilion ship & deploy (mandatory for agents)

Pavilion deploys to **`robert-4220s-projects`** only. Stone Hill www is **`~/shmspto`** → `ship-stone-hill.mjs` (treasurer).

Master map: `~/shmspto/docs/AGENT-SHIP-MAP.md` and `~/.cursor/rules/agent-ship-map.mdc`.

## After Pavilion application code ships

```bash
node scripts/ship-pavilion.mjs --target commons-pto-demo
```

| `--target` | Production URL | When |
|------------|----------------|------|
| `commons-pto-demo` | https://commons-pto-demo.vercel.app | Default — demo / product preview |
| `commons-site` | https://onpavilion.com | Marketing site changes in `commons-site/` |
| `commons-pto` | https://commons-pto.vercel.app | Legacy host — only if Rob asks |

Flow: optional parity → `git push` → poll `check-pavilion-deploy.mjs` → `--cli-fallback` if needed.

## Doppler

**`pavilion` / `dev`** — `./scripts/doppler_run.sh` or `./scripts/vercel-robert4220.sh`.

Same token as **`~/hskrg-work`**. Never `shmspto` Doppler for Pavilion deploys.

## Stone Hill (do not ship from here)

School site / portal / staff: edit **`~/shmspto`**, then `node scripts/ship-stone-hill.mjs`.  
Sync from school: `node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --from-shms --apply` **only when Rob asks**.

## Forbidden

- Bare `npx vercel`
- `deploy-pavilion.mjs` directly
- Treasurer scope / `vercel link` to Stone Hill `frontend`
- Pushing `pavilion` `main` and calling Stone Hill “shipped”
- Auto `--from-shms` after every SHMS ship

## Success criteria

`node scripts/check-pavilion-deploy.mjs --target …` passes.
